    <title>万物皆苦</title>
    <url>/2022/06/25/20220625-life-is-bitter/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>Another half year has passed, yet life hasn’t change a bit.</p>
<p>I am here now in the mall near our home. </p>
<p>The deliver guys are sitting on the chair watching TikTok.</p>
<p>A mall staff is laying her arm on the  table to take a nap.</p>
<p>I am listening to the old songs.</p>
<p>Life is bitter, life is great.</p>
]]></content>
